 add(f'{slug}-r1',f'EDIT the supplied A023 fish-book icon. Change only the cover colour and central emblem to make this tab book: {desc}. Preserve the exact original book silhouette, outline, size, angle, page edges, position and pixel style. This is an edit target; do not add text.',[ref['book'],ref['style'],ref['wood']])
